  "details": "A button in the settings of the photo camera that lets other people pick it up as if it were their own. If someone runs off with it then you could always reset the position. If taking someone else's camera into an area they shouldn't have access to would be a problem, then a solution to that is limiting the range to the same distance as when the camera is being remote controlled.",
